
# Subject: area: effect, at most 72 characters, no full stop (docs/commit-rules.md).
#   [breaking] or [results] first if it can break a user or changes a default number.
# Body: why, not what. Required for behaviour, results, data, licence or ADR changes.
#   User-visible: add a line under Unreleased in CHANGELOG.md in this commit.
#   Nothing user-visible: say "No behaviour change."
# Refer to ADR NNNN, F-xxx, #issue. No local paths, secrets, vendor text, wip.
# No trailer lines (no Signed-off-by, Co-Authored-By or session links).
